OL,3,GNEWSATherapy dogs make a difference for
OL,4,Apatients
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital staff have praised the visits
OL,7,Ffrom therapy dogs for helping lift the
OL,8,Fmood of both themselves and their
OL,9,Fpatients.
OL,11,FThe Jersey branch of the Therapy Dogs
OL,12,FNationwide carries out regular visits
OL,13,Fto Jersey Hospital as part of its work
OL,14,Fin the island.
OL,16,FIt has been nominated in the BBC Radio
OL,17,FJersey Make a Difference Awards for
OL,18,Fhelping people in the island.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
