OL,3,GNEWSATherapy dogs make a difference for
OL,4,Apatients
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudent pharmacy technician Finn
OL,7,FSpillane said: "It's really nice to
OL,8,Fhave a nice little cuddle," while
OL,9,FSuzette Jansen van Rensburg, from the
OL,10,FCritical Care Unit, said: "Everyone's
OL,11,Freally happy to see Perla the dog."
